{60}{My name is Henri Hauchecorne. I am the last survivor of the fishing village. Pirates attacked us last night. All my companions are dead...}{My name is Henri Hauchecorne. I am the last survivor of the fishing village. Pirates attacked us last night. All my companions are dead...}{}{}{}{re +5}
