{90}{Who are they, and where did they come from? I do not know. All I know is that they landed on the island's southern beach... Nothing will survive in their wake. We are living on borrowed time, but trust me, the end is near...}{Who are they, and where did they come from? I do not know. All I know is that they landed on the island's southern beach... Nothing will survive in their wake. We are living on borrowed time, but trust me, the end is near...}{}{}{}{lf1 1, re +5}
