{94}{What you do now?}{}{-4}{lf1 1, lf2 1}{150}{}

{120}{The pirates are searching for the famous treasure of Hermann Toothrot, the old hermit. Many treasure hunters have tried, but none ever found a single gold coin. At least they were peaceful... I do not even know whether the hermit is still alive; it has been so long since we saw him. Even if he is alive, people say his solitude finally drove him mad...}{The pirates are searching for the famous treasure of Hermann Toothrot, the old hermit. Many treasure hunters have tried, but none ever found a single gold coin. At least they were peaceful... I do not even know whether the hermit is still alive; it has been so long since we saw him. Even if he is alive, people say his solitude finally drove him mad...}{}{}{}{lf2 1, re +5, qu1274 1}
