{150}{All I can do is hope the pirates find the treasure before they think of coming back this way... To tell you the truth, I think that fabulous hoard is nothing more than a legend...}{All I can do is hope the pirates find the treasure before they think of coming back this way... To tell you the truth, I think that fabulous hoard is nothing more than a legend...}{}{}{}{re +5}
