{210}{I do not know whether you are sane, but... very well! Before we die, though, grant me one favor: could you bring me a bottle of Chateau Be'ron wine? There is a connoisseur in the village. "Borrow" a bottle from him for me, one last little pleasure...}{I do not know whether you are sane, but... very well! Before we die, though, grant me one favor: could you bring me a bottle of Chateau Be'ron wine? There is a connoisseur in the village. "Borrow" a bottle from him for me, one last little pleasure...}{}{}{}{}
